{"title":"2006 iTest Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Obvious_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Obvious Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Find the number of positive integral divisors of 2006.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/6/6a67991241cef39be0201fae282487a6177157b6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A)}\\, 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"39\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>First, <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Prime_factorization\" title=\"Prime factorization\">factor</a> the number 2006.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/8/e586382736dc9acc0a5d8b43d5981c6827cc2b4e.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} 2006 &amp;= 2 \\cdot 1003 \\\\ &amp;= 2 \\cdot 17 \\cdot 59 \\end{align*}\" width=\"131\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>A <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Divisor\" title=\"Divisor\">divisor</a> could include or exclude 2, include or exclude 17, and include or exclude 59.  Thus, there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/a/bfa6fbce10d2ae0629a093e179ff7f36a7816f60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^3 = \\boxed{\\textbf{(A) } 8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"97\" height=\"28\" /> positive integral divisors.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Obvious_Solution\">Obvious Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Obvious Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since there is only one answer choice, the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/a/e7ad89c6921579c89617c149e3e6be47bfdfbf47.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(A)}~8}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"58\" height=\"28\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"backg